<title>UK: Standard Life names John Cummins treasury head.</title>
<headline>Standard Life names John Cummins treasury head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurer Standard Life Assurance Company said on Wednesday it had named John Cummins head of treasury.</p>
<p>Standard Life said Cummins, previously treasurer first vice president at MBNA International Bank Ltd, would coordinate capital market transactions and banking treasury activities.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
